.wrangler/

# Point-in-time copies taken before each patch (app.js.pre_*.bak and
# friends). There are 45 of them and they total 26MB of near-identical
# copies of a 1.1MB file -- a single `git add -A` would put all of that
# in history permanently, where it cannot be removed without a rewrite.
# They are local undo, not history; git already is the history.
*.bak
